  "audio": "Supplied AIFF narration, unchanged wording and speed; loudness normalization to -16 LUFS / -1.5 dBTP, resampled 48kHz stereo AAC, silence padding only.",
  "video": "Supplied actual browser recordings at original pixel dimensions; time compression up to 2.2x only when longer than narration, otherwise original motion plus final-frame hold. Recorder stop artifacts trimmed from scene 04 after 8.8s and scene 07 after 6.2s; last clean actual video frame held. No product UI recreation, fabricated outcomes, interpolation, music, or third-party imagery.",
