    {
      "id": "04-native",
      "title": "Recorded QNX experiment",
      "text": "We cross-compiled these C services with the Q N X toolchain and ran them on Q N X eight in QEMU with KVM. A separate host receiver captured process instances and successful message-passing counters. In the risky automatic-failure experiment, killing telemetry caused S L M to replace telemetry and the controller. The sensor stayed unchanged.",
      "audio": "04-native.aiff",
      "duration": 20.340045,
      "audio_duration": 20.340045,
      "raw_duration": 9.996933,
      "edited_duration": 21.066666666666666,
      "speed_factor": 1,
