    },
    {
      "id": "07-export",
      "title": "Reproduce and share the review",
      "text": "Export the review bundle with its static report, recording, and binding result. The host product needs only Python and a browser. The MIT-licensed repository includes native source, raw evidence, CI checks, and a tutorial. BootWeave turns a hidden lifecycle relationship into a reviewable change and a reproducible experiment.",
